# They Vote For You API key — get a free one at https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/users/sign_up
# Low-volume, non-commercial use is free. Never commit the real key.
# The real key lives in GitHub Actions secrets for CI/deploy; this .env is for local development only.
# It is the sole credential the pipeline needs — every snapshot is a direct TVFY API capture (there
# is no external web-archive path any more).
TVFY_API_KEY=your-key-here
